WEBVTT

00:00:00.198 --> 00:00:01.400
Tailwind beyond the web.

00:00:03.218 --> 00:00:04.420
Use familiar classes

00:00:04.432 --> 00:00:06.860
to shape spacing, corners, and color.

00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:11.454
Generate styles, transform classes,

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.872
adapt to each target.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:17.063
Build for the web, mini programs,

00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:18.229
and app WebViews.

00:00:19.056 --> 00:00:21.412
Reach native ecosystems
with uni-app x,

00:00:21.568 --> 00:00:23.203
React Native, and Lynx.

00:00:27.218 --> 00:00:29.033
Built for Tailwind CSS 4.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:30.906
Connect your framework

00:00:30.918 --> 00:00:31.928
and your build tools.

00:00:35.248 --> 00:00:36.570
For a Vite web project,

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:37.868
install the packages,

00:00:37.988 --> 00:00:39.539
import your CSS entry,

00:00:39.743 --> 00:00:40.969
then register the plugin.

00:00:41.797 --> 00:00:43.359
Choose the guide for your target.

00:00:46.218 --> 00:00:48.309
Build CSS and watch for changes.

00:00:49.137 --> 00:00:50.471
Merge classes and manage

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.625
component variants.

00:00:55.218 --> 00:00:56.228
Pick your framework.

00:00:57.055 --> 00:00:57.896
Start building.
